--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library implements the DeepStream YAML parser API, which sets the
properties of a GStreamer element from a group in a YAML configuration file. It
provides one parsing entry point per element type, covering sources, streammux,
inference, tracker, analytics, OSD, tiler, encoder, sinks, message conversion
and message brokers, and reports whether the group was applied, disabled or
failed.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ Set CUDA_VER in the MakeFile as per platform.
  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvds_yml_parser.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/
